# The Alliance Warrior armor chain: Yorus Barleybrew, The Rethban Gauntlet and
# The Shieldsmith (1698, 1699, 1702, level 20-22: Furen's Favor), Fire Hardened
# Mail and Furen's Armor (1701, 1782, level 28), then one piece by race:
# Humans from Grimand Elmore in Stormwind (1700, 1705, 1706: Fire Hardened
# Coif), Night Elves from Mathiel in Darnassus (1703, 1710, 1711: Fire Hardened
# Leggings), Dwarves and Gnomes from Klockmort Spannerspan in Ironforge (1704,
# 1708, 1709: Fire Hardened Gauntlets). The data gives Skyborne none of the
# three: their chain ends with Furen's Armor.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# objectives, drops and places (the Rethban Caverns point is the quest's own
# objective position); Forever's Warrior class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards and
# Forever's changes (none for this chain); the Razorfen Kraul entrance from
# data/forever/dungeons.json (The Barrens 42.9,90.2, live frame). Roogug, who
# drops the Vial of Phlogiston, has no spawn in the data: he is a quilboar
# elite inside Razorfen Kraul (zone 491,
# https://wowwiki-archive.fandom.com/wiki/Vial_of_Phlogiston).
# No leveling guide takes this chain: it needs a dungeon (Razorfen Kraul) and
# runs from Redridge to Stonetalon, the Wetlands and the capitals.
# Fire Hardened Mail and the pieces after it (level 28-30) are near or above
# the beta's level cap: that part is written from the data, not from play.

step Yorus Barleybrew (Stormwind)
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 20, Wu Shen in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle, sends you to Yorus Barleybrew in Redridge.
  level 20
  accept 1698 npc 5479                        -- Wu Shen

step Yorus Barleybrew (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 20, Kelv Sternhammer, the warrior trainer of Ironforge, sends you to Yorus Barleybrew in Redridge.
  level 20
  accept 1698 npc 5113                        -- Kelv Sternhammer

step Yorus Barleybrew (Darnassus)
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip At 20, Darnath Bladesinger, the warrior trainer of Darnassus, sends you to Yorus Barleybrew in Redridge.
  level 20
  accept 1698 npc 7315                        -- Darnath Bladesinger

step The Rethban Gauntlet
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Yorus Barleybrew is in Lakeshire, at the inn. His test is timed: run north-west into the Rethban Caverns, reach the first fork and come back to him before the timer runs out. Do not die and release your spirit.
  turnin 1698                                 -- Yorus Barleybrew
  accept 1699
  complete 1699                               -- Enter the Rethban Caverns and come back
  turnin 1699
  accept 1702

step The Shieldsmith
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Furen Longbeard works in the Dwarven District of Stormwind. He keeps the Cask of Scalder and gives you Furen's Favor, a shield; Fire Hardened Mail is a level 28 quest.
  turnin 1702 reward 6970                     -- Furen Longbeard
  accept 1701

step Scorched Spider Fangs
  zone Wetlands
  tip The Leech Stalkers and Cave Stalkers crawl around 46,61 in the middle of the Wetlands; they drop the Scorched Spider Fang.
  collect 6838 quest 1701.1                   -- Scorched Spider Fang

step Charred and Galvanized Horns
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip The Fledgling and Young Chimaeras roam the south-west of Stonetalon, with the Chimaera Matriarch among them: the young ones drop the Charred Horn, the Matriarch the Galvanized Horn.
  collect 6839 quest 1701.2                   -- Charred Horn from the young chimaeras
  collect 6840 quest 1701.3                   -- Galvanized Horn from the Chimaera Matriarch

step Roogug in Razorfen Kraul
  zone The Barrens
  tip Roogug is an elite quilboar inside Razorfen Kraul, the dungeon at the south end of the Barrens; he drops the Vial of Phlogiston. Razorfen Kraul is a dungeon: grouping up is advised.
  collect 6841 quest 1701.4 @42.9,90.2 live   -- Vial of Phlogiston, from Roogug

step Furen's Armor
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Back to Furen Longbeard in the Dwarven District. He sends you on to a smith of your own race.
  turnin 1701                                 -- Furen Longbeard
  accept 1782
  turnin 1782
  accept 1700 only Human
  accept 1703 only NightElf
  accept 1704 only Dwarf,Gnome

